1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,740
Tasavvur qiling: ertalab uyg'ondingiz,

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,350
telefoningizni qo'lga oldingiz,

3
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:05,889
yangiliklarni ko'rdingiz.

4
00:00:05,889 --> 00:00:07,447
Bir davlat urush boshlagan,

5
00:00:07,447 --> 00:00:09,426
boshqa davlatda dollar qimmatlashgan,

6
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:12,192
dunyodagi eng boy insonlardan biri bir kunda

7
00:00:12,192 --> 00:00:13,680
milliardlab dollar yo'qotgan.

8
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,054
Siz esa odatdagidek ishga ketdingiz.

9
00:00:16,054 --> 00:00:18,121
Ammo bir narsani o'ylab ko'rganmisiz?

10
00:00:18,121 --> 00:00:20,754
Sizning hayotingizga ta'sir qilayotgan bu

11
00:00:20,754 --> 00:00:22,800
qarorlarni aslida kim qabul qiladi?

12
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,026
Prezidentlarmi?

13
00:00:24,026 --> 00:00:25,636
Milliarderlarmi?

14
00:00:25,636 --> 00:00:26,440
Bankirlarmi?

15
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:29,249
Yoki biz televizorda hech qachon ko'rmaydigan,

16
00:00:29,249 --> 00:00:30,800
ismini ham bilmaydigan odamlarmi?

17
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:34,074
Eng qizig'i, dunyodagi eng qudratli inson

18
00:00:34,074 --> 00:00:36,599
ham ba'zan o'zi xohlagan qarorni qabul qila

19
00:00:36,599 --> 00:00:36,900
olmaydi.

20
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:39,327
Chunki uning ortida iqtisodiyot,

21
00:00:39,327 --> 00:00:42,754
qonunlar, banklar, harbiy tizim va millionlab

22
00:00:42,754 --> 00:00:44,200
insonlarning manfaatlari turadi.

23
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,885
Bugun biz dunyoni kimlar boshqarayotganini

24
00:00:46,885 --> 00:00:48,100
tushunishga harakat qilamiz.

25
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:51,198
Va hikoyamiz oxirida siz oddiy bir savolga

26
00:00:51,198 --> 00:00:52,820
boshqacha qaray boshlashingiz mumkin.

27
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:55,160
Haqiqiy hokimiyat kimning qo'lida?

28
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:57,780
Birinchi navbatda prezidentlardan boshlaymiz.

29
00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:00,220
Dunyodagi eng kuchli siyosiy lavozimlardan

30
00:01:00,220 --> 00:01:02,460
biri — Amerika Qo'shma Shtatlari prezidenti.

31
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:05,540
U ulkan harbiy kuchga ega davlatni boshqaradi.

32
00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:08,608
Yadroviy qurollar bo'yicha favqulodda vakolatlarga

33
00:01:08,608 --> 00:01:08,740
ega.

34
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:11,260
Uning qarorlari xalqaro savdoga,

35
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:13,660
urushlarga va diplomatik munosabatlarga

36
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:14,600
ta'sir qilishi mumkin.

37
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,820
Lekin Amerika Qo'shma Shtatlari prezidenti

38
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:18,678
ham hamma narsani bir o'zi hal qila

39
00:01:18,678 --> 00:01:18,980
olmaydi.

40
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:21,188
Kongress bor, sudlar bor,

41
00:01:21,188 --> 00:01:22,200
Konstitutsiya bor.

42
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:24,686
Prezident biror qonunni o'zgartirmoqchi

43
00:01:24,686 --> 00:01:24,940
bo'lsa,

44
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:27,254
boshqa siyosiy institutlarning qarshiligiga

45
00:01:27,254 --> 00:01:27,980
duch kelishi mumkin.

46
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,946
Demak, hatto eng qudratli davlat rahbari

47
00:01:30,946 --> 00:01:32,620
ham cheksiz hokimiyatga ega emas.

48
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:34,780
Unda dunyoni kim boshqaradi?

49
00:01:34,980 --> 00:01:37,020
Balki pulni boshqaruvchilardir?

50
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:39,880
Bu savolga javob topish uchun banklar dunyosiga

51
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:40,200
kiramiz.

52
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:41,400
Tasavvur qiling.

53
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:43,993
Bir kuni televizorda Amerika Federal Rezerv

54
00:01:43,993 --> 00:01:46,367
tizimi foiz stavkasini oshirgani haqida

55
00:01:46,367 --> 00:01:46,900
xabar chiqdi.

56
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:49,176
Ko'pchilik bu yangilikka e'tibor bermaydi,

57
00:01:49,176 --> 00:01:51,492
ammo uning ta'siri butun dunyoga tarqalishi

58
00:01:51,492 --> 00:01:51,760
mumkin.

59
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:53,260
Kreditlar qimmatlashadi.

60
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:55,728
Investorlar pullarini boshqa bozorlarga

61
00:01:55,728 --> 00:01:56,100
ko'chiradi.

62
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:59,267
Ayrim davlatlarning milliy valyutalari bosim

63
00:01:59,267 --> 00:01:59,820
ostida qoladi.

64
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,089
Natijada minglab kilometr uzoqlikda yashayotgan

65
00:02:03,089 --> 00:02:05,918
oddiy inson ham bu qarorning oqibatini sezishi

66
00:02:05,918 --> 00:02:06,220
mumkin.

67
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:09,556
Masalan, O'zbekistondagi tadbirkor import

68
00:02:09,556 --> 00:02:10,680
mahsulot sotib olmoqchi.

69
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,564
Agar dollar kursi o'zgarsa,

70
00:02:12,564 --> 00:02:14,780
uning xarajatlari ham o'zgarishi mumkin.

71
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:18,193
Demak, Amerikadagi moliyaviy qaror Toshkentdagi

72
00:02:18,193 --> 00:02:20,824
do'kon narxiga ham bilvosita ta'sir qilishi

73
00:02:20,824 --> 00:02:21,440
ehtimoli bor.

74
00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:23,620
Lekin bu yerda muhim jihat mavjud.

75
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:26,312
Federal Rezerv tizimi butun dunyoni boshqaradigan

76
00:02:26,312 --> 00:02:27,760
maxfiy tashkilot emas.

77
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:30,620
U AQShning markaziy bank tizimi bo'lib,

78
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:33,340
qonuniy vakolatlari doirasida faoliyat yuritadi.

79
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:36,293
Shunga qaramay, dollar xalqaro moliya tizimida

80
00:02:36,293 --> 00:02:38,380
juda katta o'rin egallagani sababli,

81
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:41,073
uning qarorlari dunyo iqtisodiyotiga kuchli

82
00:02:41,073 --> 00:02:41,920
ta'sir ko'rsatadi.

83
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:44,360
Endi bundan ham qiziqroq savol.

84
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,819
Agar pul dunyodagi eng katta kuchlardan

85
00:02:47,819 --> 00:02:50,700
biri bo'lsa, eng katta pullar kimning qo'lida?

86
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:53,260
Bu yerda uchta nomga duch kelamiz.

87
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:56,320
BlackRock, Vanguard, State Street.

88
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:59,641
Bu kompaniyalar dunyodagi eng yirik aktivlarni

89
00:02:59,641 --> 00:03:01,606
boshqaruvchi moliyaviy tashkilotlar qatoriga

90
00:03:01,606 --> 00:03:01,860
kiradi.

91
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:04,463
Ular boshqarayotgan mablag'lar trillionlab

92
00:03:04,463 --> 00:03:05,460
dollar bilan o'lchanadi.

93
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:08,305
Ularning investitsiya fondlari orqali dunyoning

94
00:03:08,305 --> 00:03:10,322
ko'plab mashhur kompaniyalariga sarmoya

95
00:03:10,322 --> 00:03:10,800
kiritilgan.

96
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,207
Texnologiya, energetika, bank,

97
00:03:13,207 --> 00:03:15,200
farmatsevtika va boshqa sohalar.

98
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:18,280
Tasavvur qiling, siz bir nechta yirik kompaniyaning

99
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,460
aksiyalariga ega bo'lgan fondni boshqarasiz.

100
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:23,470
Bu sizga korporativ qarorlarga ta'sir ko'rsatish

101
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:24,520
imkoniyatini berishi mumkin.

102
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:27,185
Ayrim hollarda aksiyadorlar direktorlar

103
00:03:27,185 --> 00:03:28,200
kengashini saylashda

104
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:30,478
va muhim masalalar bo'yicha ovoz berishda

105
00:03:30,478 --> 00:03:30,940
qatnashadi.

106
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:33,426
Ammo bu yerda ko'pchilik chalkashtiradigan

107
00:03:33,426 --> 00:03:34,520
juda muhim farq bor.

108
00:03:34,620 --> 00:03:37,072
Bu tashkilotlar boshqarayotgan trillionlab

109
00:03:37,072 --> 00:03:39,523
dollarlarning hammasi ularning shaxsiy puli

110
00:03:39,523 --> 00:03:39,800
emas.

111
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:42,559
Ularning katta qismi pensiya jamg'armalari,

112
00:03:42,559 --> 00:03:45,129
investitsiya fondlari va oddiy mijozlarga

113
00:03:45,129 --> 00:03:45,480
tegishli.

114
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:48,031
Shuning uchun bu kompaniyalar dunyodagi

115
00:03:48,031 --> 00:03:50,300
barcha bizneslarning yagona egasi

116
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:53,200
yoki yashirin hukmdori degan xulosa noto'g'ri.

117
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:55,724
Lekin ularning moliya bozoridagi ta'siri

118
00:03:55,724 --> 00:03:56,440
juda katta.

119
00:03:56,540 --> 00:03:58,997
Va bu ta'sir bizni keyingi savolga olib

120
00:03:58,997 --> 00:03:59,220
keladi.

121
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:01,920
Pul muhimroqmi yoki axborot?

122
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,583
Bir o'ylab ko'ring:

123
00:04:03,583 --> 00:04:05,960
har kuni telefoningizni necha marta tekshirasiz?

124
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,640
Instagramda nima ko'rasiz?

125
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:10,220
YouTube sizga qaysi videoni tavsiya qiladi?

126
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,799
Google qidiruvda qaysi natijani birinchi

127
00:04:12,799 --> 00:04:13,200
ko'rsatadi?

128
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:16,480
Siz bu qarorlarning hammasini o'zingiz qabul

129
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,940
qilyapman deb o'ylashingiz mumkin.

130
00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:21,175
Ammo siz ko'rayotgan axborotning katta qismi

131
00:04:21,175 --> 00:04:22,800
algoritmlar orqali saralanadi.

132
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:25,547
Algoritmlar sizning qiziqishlaringiz,

133
00:04:25,547 --> 00:04:28,131
avvalgi harakatlaringiz va boshqa signallar

134
00:04:28,131 --> 00:04:29,940
asosida kontent tavsiya qiladi.

135
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:33,135
Natijada bir inson urush haqidagi videolarni

136
00:04:33,135 --> 00:04:33,780
ko'proq ko'rsa,

137
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:36,580
boshqa inson iqtisodiy yangiliklarni,

138
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:39,274
yana boshqasi ko'ngilochar videolarni ko'rishi

139
00:04:39,274 --> 00:04:39,580
mumkin.

140
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,725
Ularning har biri dunyoni boshqacha tasavvur

141
00:04:42,725 --> 00:04:43,240
qila boshlaydi.

142
00:04:43,460 --> 00:04:46,566
Mana shu yerda yangi turdagi hokimiyat paydo

143
00:04:46,566 --> 00:04:46,880
bo'ladi.

144
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:49,920
Bu hokimiyat davlat chegaralariga bog'lanmagan.

145
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:53,200
U insonlarning diqqatini boshqarish imkoniyatiga

146
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:53,600
asoslangan.

147
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:56,901
Texnologik platformalar milliardlab foydalanuvchilarning

148
00:04:56,901 --> 00:04:59,493
qanday axborotga duch kelishiga ta'sir ko'rsatishi

149
00:04:59,493 --> 00:04:59,800
mumkin.

150
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:02,540
Lekin bu har bir foydalanuvchining fikrini

151
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:04,560
to'liq nazorat qiladi degani emas.

152
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:06,924
Insonning qarashlariga oilasi,

153
00:05:06,924 --> 00:05:09,912
ta'limi, shaxsiy tajribasi va boshqa ko'plab

154
00:05:09,912 --> 00:05:11,060
omillar ham ta'sir qiladi.

155
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:14,029
Shunday bo'lsa-da, bugungi dunyoda axborotni

156
00:05:14,029 --> 00:05:16,000
tarqatish kuchi nihoyatda muhim.

157
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:19,053
Chunki insonlar nimaga ishonishi ularning

158
00:05:19,053 --> 00:05:21,062
qanday qaror qabul qilishiga ham ta'sir

159
00:05:21,062 --> 00:05:21,480
ko'rsatadi.

160
00:05:21,580 --> 00:05:24,076
Endi dunyoning yana bir qudratli kuchiga

161
00:05:24,076 --> 00:05:24,740
e'tibor qarating.

162
00:05:24,940 --> 00:05:26,071
Energiya.

163
00:05:26,071 --> 00:05:28,040
Neft, gaz, elektr.

164
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:30,968
Bir davlatda neft qazib olish kamaydi degan

165
00:05:30,968 --> 00:05:32,918
xabar chiqishi bilan xalqaro bozorlarda

166
00:05:32,918 --> 00:05:34,200
narxlar o'zgarishi mumkin.

167
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,601
Bu o'zgarish transport xarajatlariga,

168
00:05:36,601 --> 00:05:39,122
mahsulot ishlab chiqarishga va oziq-ovqat

169
00:05:39,122 --> 00:05:40,080
narxlariga ta'sir qiladi.

170
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:43,350
Energetika resurslari ustidan nazorat davlatlarga

171
00:05:43,350 --> 00:05:45,749
iqtisodiy va geosiyosiy ustunlik berishi

172
00:05:45,749 --> 00:05:46,040
mumkin.

173
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:49,070
Shuning uchun neft va gaz faqat yoqilg'i

174
00:05:49,070 --> 00:05:49,300
emas.

175
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:52,340
Ular xalqaro siyosatning ham muhim vositasidir.

176
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:55,487
Ammo dunyoni faqat neft kompaniyalari boshqaradi

177
00:05:55,487 --> 00:05:56,360
deyish ham xato.

178
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:59,080
Chunki energetika bozorida davlatlar,

179
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:01,309
ishlab chiqaruvchilar, iste'molchilar,

180
00:06:01,309 --> 00:06:04,314
savdo tashkilotlari va boshqa ko'plab ishtirokchilar

181
00:06:04,314 --> 00:06:04,520
mavjud.

182
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:07,220
Ularning manfaatlari doimo bir xil emas.

183
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:10,422
Va aynan shu qarama-qarshilik dunyo siyosatining

184
00:06:10,422 --> 00:06:11,520
muhim qismini tashkil qiladi.

185
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:15,147
Endi esa internetda eng ko'p muhokama qilinadigan

186
00:06:15,147 --> 00:06:15,920
mavzuga kelamiz.

187
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:18,440
Dunyoni maxfiy guruhlar boshqaradimi?

188
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:21,245
Siz Bilderberg uchrashuvlari haqida eshitgan

189
00:06:21,245 --> 00:06:21,940
bo'lishingiz mumkin.

190
00:06:22,060 --> 00:06:24,096
Bu uchrashuvlarda siyosat,

191
00:06:24,096 --> 00:06:27,315
biznes, moliya, ilm-fan va boshqa sohalarning

192
00:06:27,315 --> 00:06:28,740
nufuzli vakillari qatnashadi.

193
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:31,524
Uchrashuvlar yopiq muhokama shaklida o'tkazilgani

194
00:06:31,524 --> 00:06:33,715
sababli ular haqida turli taxminlar paydo

195
00:06:33,715 --> 00:06:34,020
bo'lgan.

196
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:37,211
Ba'zilar hatto dunyoning eng muhim qarorlari

197
00:06:37,211 --> 00:06:39,240
aynan shu yerda qabul qilinishiga ishonadi.

198
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:42,365
Ammo bunday da'voni tasdiqlaydigan ishonchli

199
00:06:42,365 --> 00:06:43,420
dalillar mavjud emas.

200
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,980
Nufuzli insonlarning bir joyda uchrashishi

201
00:06:46,060 --> 00:06:48,648
ular barcha davlatlarni yashirin boshqarayotganini

202
00:06:48,648 --> 00:06:49,320
anglatmaydi.

203
00:06:49,500 --> 00:06:51,736
Shubhasiz, bunday uchrashuvlar elitalar

204
00:06:51,736 --> 00:06:53,120
o'rtasida fikr almashish

205
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:55,016
va aloqalarni mustahkamlash imkoniyatini

206
00:06:55,016 --> 00:06:55,600
yaratishi mumkin.

207
00:06:55,740 --> 00:06:58,180
Bu ikki tushuncha orasida katta farq bor.

208
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:00,100
Ta'sir ko'rsatish boshqa,

209
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:02,900
butun dunyoni boshqarish esa mutlaqo boshqa.

210
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:05,727
Xo'sh, unda nega insonlar dunyoni bitta

211
00:07:05,727 --> 00:07:07,631
yashirin guruh boshqarishiga ishonishga

212
00:07:07,631 --> 00:07:07,880
moyil?

213
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,440
Sababi oddiy.

214
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,700
Dunyo nihoyatda murakkab.

215
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:13,332
Bir vaqtning o'zida urushlar,

216
00:07:13,332 --> 00:07:16,344
iqtisodiy inqirozlar, siyosiy kelishmovchiliklar

217
00:07:16,344 --> 00:07:18,380
va texnologik o'zgarishlar sodir bo'ladi.

218
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:21,348
Inson miyasi esa murakkab voqealarga sodda

219
00:07:21,348 --> 00:07:22,360
tushuntirish izlaydi.

220
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:24,969
Ba'zan yuzlab sabablarni o'rganishdan ko'ra,

221
00:07:24,969 --> 00:07:27,658
hammasining ortida bitta maxfiy kuch borligiga

222
00:07:27,658 --> 00:07:28,900
ishonish osonroq tuyuladi.

223
00:07:29,140 --> 00:07:31,700
Ammo tarix bizga boshqa narsani ko'rsatadi.

224
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:34,240
Dunyo ko'pincha bitta markazdan emas,

225
00:07:34,340 --> 00:07:36,488
bir-biri bilan raqobatlashayotgan ko'plab

226
00:07:36,488 --> 00:07:37,620
kuchlar ta'sirida shakllanadi.

227
00:07:37,740 --> 00:07:40,053
Amerika Qo'shma Shtatlari o'z manfaatini

228
00:07:40,053 --> 00:07:40,540
himoya qiladi.

229
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:43,406
Xitoy o'z iqtisodiy va strategik maqsadlarini

230
00:07:43,406 --> 00:07:43,800
ko'zlaydi.

231
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:46,866
Rossiya o'z xavfsizlik va siyosiy manfaatlarini

232
00:07:46,866 --> 00:07:47,420
ilgari suradi.

233
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:50,380
Yevropa davlatlari o'zaro hamkorlik qiladi.

234
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,945
Lekin ayrim masalalarda ular o'rtasida ham

235
00:07:52,945 --> 00:07:54,040
kelishmovchiliklar mavjud.

236
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:56,500
Yirik kompaniyalar foyda olishga intiladi.

237
00:07:56,660 --> 00:07:59,052
Banklar moliyaviy barqarorlik va daromad

238
00:07:59,052 --> 00:08:00,240
masalalarini hisobga oladi.

239
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,615
Oddiy insonlar esa saylovlarda,

240
00:08:02,615 --> 00:08:05,090
norozilik namoyishlarida, xaridlarda va

241
00:08:05,090 --> 00:08:07,560
kundalik qarorlarda bu tizimga ta'sir qiladi.

242
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:10,140
Bularning hammasi bir-biri bilan bog'langan.

243
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:13,260
Va endi eng muhim savolga qaytamiz.

244
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:15,660
Dunyoni aslida kim boshqaradi?

245
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:18,000
Javob siz kutgandan murakkabroq.

246
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:20,259
Dunyoda hamma narsani nazorat qiladigan

247
00:08:20,259 --> 00:08:22,067
yagona prezident, milliarder,

248
00:08:22,067 --> 00:08:24,840
bank yoki maxfiy tashkilot borligi isbotlanmagan.

249
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:28,080
Haqiqiy hokimiyat turli markazlarga bo'lingan.

250
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:30,320
Davlatlar harbiy va siyosiy kuchga ega.

251
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:32,835
Markaziy banklar moliyaviy sharoitlarga

252
00:08:32,835 --> 00:08:33,400
ta'sir qiladi.

253
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:35,879
Yirik korporatsiyalar investitsiyalar va

254
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:37,660
texnologiyalar orqali ta'sir ko'rsatadi.

255
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:40,261
Axborot platformalari odamlar ko'radigan

256
00:08:40,261 --> 00:08:41,520
ma'lumotlarni saralaydi.

257
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:44,231
Xalqaro tashkilotlar davlatlar o'rtasidagi

258
00:08:44,231 --> 00:08:46,235
hamkorlik va qoidalarni shakllantirishda

259
00:08:46,235 --> 00:08:46,640
qatnashadi.

260
00:08:46,740 --> 00:08:48,215
Va eng muhimi,

261
00:08:48,215 --> 00:08:50,400
bu kuchlarning hech biri mutlaq emas.

262
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:51,927
Ular bir-biriga bog'liq,

263
00:08:51,927 --> 00:08:53,530
bir-biri bilan raqobatlashadi,

264
00:08:53,530 --> 00:08:56,220
ba'zan kelishadi, ba'zan esa to'qnashadi.

265
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:59,203
Lekin bu hikoyaning eng qiziq tomoni hali

266
00:08:59,203 --> 00:08:59,520
oldinda.

267
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:02,102
Tasavvur qiling, siz hech qachon uchratmagan

268
00:09:02,102 --> 00:09:04,537
inson foiz stavkasi bo'yicha qaror qabul

269
00:09:04,537 --> 00:09:04,740
qiladi.

270
00:09:04,820 --> 00:09:07,166
Siz hech qachon ko'rmagan kompaniya siz

271
00:09:07,166 --> 00:09:09,580
foydalanadigan ilovaning algoritmini o'zgartiradi.

272
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:12,146
Siz yashamaydigan davlatda qabul qilingan

273
00:09:12,146 --> 00:09:12,780
qaror esa

274
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,305
siz sotib oladigan mahsulot narxiga ta'sir

275
00:09:15,305 --> 00:09:15,800
qilishi mumkin.

276
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:18,957
Demak, zamonaviy dunyoda hokimiyat faqat

277
00:09:18,957 --> 00:09:20,020
prezident saroyida

278
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,940
yoki parlament binosida emas.

279
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:23,269
U moliya tizimida,

280
00:09:23,269 --> 00:09:26,800
texnologiyada, energetikada, axborot oqimida

281
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:29,718
va qonunlarni shakllantiradigan institutlarda

282
00:09:29,718 --> 00:09:30,220
ham mavjud.

283
00:09:30,340 --> 00:09:32,580
Shuning uchun bugun eng muhim savol

284
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:34,777
"Dunyoni bitta odam boshqaradimi?" degan

285
00:09:34,777 --> 00:09:35,340
savol emas.

286
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,696
Eng muhim savol —

287
00:09:36,696 --> 00:09:39,177
bizning hayotimizga ta'sir qilayotgan qarorlar

288
00:09:39,177 --> 00:09:39,660
qayerda,

289
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:43,033
kim tomonidan va qanday nazorat ostida qabul

290
00:09:43,033 --> 00:09:43,460
qilinyapti.

291
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:45,980
Chunki haqiqiy kuchni tushunish uchun

292
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:48,400
uning ortidan afsonalar izlash shart emas.

293
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,580
Ba'zan eng katta ta'sir

294
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:52,600
ko'z oldimizda ishlayotgan tizimlarning

295
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,800
o'zida yashiringan bo'ladi.

296
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,420
Endi sizga savol.

297
00:09:55,540 --> 00:09:58,390
Sizningcha, bugungi dunyoda eng katta kuch

298
00:09:58,390 --> 00:09:58,660
kimda?

299
00:09:59,260 --> 00:10:00,060
Prezidentlardami?

300
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:01,380
Milliarderlardami?

301
00:10:01,780 --> 00:10:02,560
Banklardami?

302
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:05,393
Yoki axborotni boshqarayotgan texnologik

303
00:10:05,393 --> 00:10:06,240
kompaniyalardami?

304
00:10:06,660 --> 00:10:08,580
Fikringizni izohlarda yozib qoldiring.

305
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:11,360
Balki dunyoni tushunishning birinchi qadami

306
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:14,060
aynan shu savolga javob izlashdan boshlanar.
